//! Content editors
//!
//! This module provides the main content editing views:
//!
//! - `TabEditor` - Guitar tablature editing
//! - `PianoRollEditor` - MIDI note editing
//! - `ArrangementEditor` - Timeline clip/region editing
//! - `WaveformEditor` - Audio waveform editing
//! - `AutomationEditor` - Parameter automation lanes

